2067 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Yes\056 Your list is strong\054 but right now it\031s too broad\056 Make it a 3\055layer system so users don\031t get overloaded\056\npop\055up banners design\n1\051 Data Collection \050Input Layer\051\n1\056 \140Passive\140\072 AI accept\057edit\057reject behavior\054 time\055to\055decision\054 revision depth\054 context switching\056\n2\056 \140Active\140\072 2\055tap check\055ins only at key moments\072\n\055 \034Was this your intent\077\035 \050\140Yes \057 Not sure \057 No\140\051\n\055 \034Confidence\035 \050\1401\0235\140\051\n3\056 \140Context\140\072 deadline pressure\054 fatigue\054 task type \050study\057work\057personal\051\056\n\n2\051 Visualization \050Sense\055making Layer\051\n1\056 Agency Index Timeline \050primary graph\051\072 trend across day\057week\056\n2\056 Decision Composition Donut \050secondary\051\072 autonomous vs AI\055led vs mixed for selected period\056\n3\056 Top Drift Drivers \050ranked cards\051\072 \034Low sleep \053 high deadline \053 high auto\055accept\056\035\n4\056 Intent Map \050replace broad mind map\051\072 only for one task\057project to compare planned intent vs final output\056\n\npop\055up banners design\n3\051 Sensory Perception\057Enhancement \050Action Layer\051\n1\056 Live Agency Banner\072 \140High \057 Medium \057 Low agency\140 \053 one\055line reason\056\n2\056 Interventions when low agency\072\n\055 \140Pause 30s\140\n\055 \140Show 2 alternatives\140\n\055 \140Manual\055first mode\140\n\055 \140Intent reset prompt\140\n3\056 Plan Mode\072 AI can suggest what to consider\054 never final decisions by default\056\n\nHow to prevent info overload\n1\056 Default Home shows only\072 Agency score\054 1 graph\054 top 2 insights\054 1 action button\056\n2\056 Progressive disclosure\072 deeper charts only on tap\056\n3\056 Prioritize insights by \140impact x confidence\140\056\n4\056 Alert timing\072\n\055 Real\055time only for high\055risk moments\056\n\055 Daily digest for patterns\056\n\055 Weekly report for behaviour change\056)
     /K [ 25 ]
     /P 2068 0 R
     /Pg 2042 0 R
     /S /Span
