  << /ActualText (Interface in Everyday life\nIntegrated into technology with general AI system\nTrack accepted AI suggestions\054 override rate\054 regret\055after\055action\054 confidence mismatch\056\n\034agency guardrails\035 \050pause before send\054 alternative suggestions\054 manual mode windows\051\n\nUser stories\072\n\050students doing assignments\057essays using ai\051Record original intent by user before generating text by ai\054 so that the student can check whether their own voice is still being preserved\056 this makes sure that the final submission still reflects students\031 original idea\n\050early\055career workers\051the app flags when the employee accepts too many ai decisions without secondary verification\057review\nseasoned professionals \nSoftware engineering\072 the app will prompt after action is performed \050\034was this decision yours or ai\031s\077\035\051to make sure that the user is taking ownership of their code\056 \nteam lead\072 weekly summary of agency index patterns to track when and what factors are leading to over\055reliance on ai\nlawyers\057consultants\072 whenever there are high\055stake situations\054 the agency index threshold drops\054 to ensure that more manual decisions are being made\056\nmedical professionals\072  making sure that the agency index threshold is very low\054 forcing professionals to consider factors that have been missed by ai\056 also encourages secondary verification in the form lateral research required to make such decisions \050think about writing 2 user stories for diagnostics and preventative care\051\n high\055stakes email\072 prompt user to review\057read the email once before sending it to boss\057client\057professor\056 The system would highlight main points of the email for review\054 and use personality profile to ensure that your intent\057voice is being conveyed\056)
